  "content": "\n\n![banner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c0c96df2e4815806b34c8de6c35f1b1e65f13f9f.png)\n## 關於此資源包：\n此資源包透過在遊戲介面中加入毛茸茸元素，變更了介面紋理。\n\n**適合獸迷 XD**\n\n\n\n# 注意：\n請避免將此資源包與其他類似資源包同時安裝，以防發生衝突。\n\n# 專屬版本 (EV)\n\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/eNmAyyem9s\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/98ae7b686377cf9891aa980d5b3c83581ff22c56.png\" alt=\"DT_EV\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated; image-rendering: crisp-edges;\">\n</a> ᅠᅠᅠ <a href=\"https://discord.gg/eNmAyyem9s\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f3f327e8fec6daac415b54d57e11d6ba52a463ff.png\" alt=\"LT_EV\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated; image-rendering: crisp-edges;\">\n</a>\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------\n\n# 附加資源包\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/furry-in-simple-voice-chat\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ba07d87160313c495ac65b668aa20279615c32c6.png\" alt=\"FISVC\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated; image-rendering: crisp-edges;\">\n</a>",
